### DispatchService walkthrough (development plan 1.4), as nag (Dispatcher)
# Start `cds watch`, then run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client).
# Later requests reuse IDs from the named responses above them.

@server = http://localhost:4004
@dispatch = {{server}}/odata/v4/dispatch
@auth = Basic nag:
@order = 6100000002

### List: freight orders still to tender (orders with a carrier are left out), one page
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$top=10&$count=true&$orderby=TransportationOrder
  &$select=TransportationOrder,TransportationMode,sourceLocation,destinationLocation,pickupDateTime,dispatchStatus,bestQuote,bestQuoteCurrency,quoteCount,quoteDeadline,deadlineExpired
Authorization: {{auth}}

### List: filter on local fields (resolved locally, paging stays correct)
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$count=true&$filter=dispatchStatus eq 'TENDERING' or dispatchStatus eq 'AWARDED'
Authorization: {{auth}}

### List: orders whose open round is past its deadline
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$count=true&$filter=deadlineExpired eq true
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Open one order: creates its dispatch (NEW) on first open
# @name openOrder
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')?$expand=dispatch,freightUnits,_FreightOrderItem,_FreightOrderStop($expand=_FreightOrderStage)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Freight units of the order (also: FreightOrders('…')/freightUnits)
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightUnits?$filter=freightOrderId eq '{{order}}'
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Active carriers (value help)
GET {{dispatch}}/Carriers?$select=carrierId,name,city
Authorization: {{auth}}

@dispatchKey = ID={{openOrder.response.body.dispatch.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true

### Start tender (bound to the freight order): round n+1 with one INVITED offer per carrier. PEER can be awarded
### before the deadline; with BROADCAST, award only after it has passed.
POST {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')/DispatchService.startTender
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "PEER", "deadline": "2099-12-31T12:00:00Z", "carriers": ["10300001", "10300002", "10300003"] }

### Rounds and offers
# @name rounds
GET {{dispatch}}/Dispatch({{dispatchKey}})/rounds?$orderby=roundNumber desc&$expand=offers($select=ID,carrierId,carrierName,status_code,price,currency_code)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Rule check: an INVITED offer cannot be awarded (expect 400 OFFER_NOT_QUOTED)
POST {{dispatch}}/CarrierOffers(ID={{rounds.response.body.$.value[0].offers[0].ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/DispatchService.award
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### (Enter a quote for the first offer as satish: see tender-flow.http, TenderService submitQuote)

### Award the quoted offer: WON, other quotes LOST, unanswered EXPIRED, round closed,
### dispatch AWARDED with carrier, price, user and timestamp
POST {{dispatch}}/CarrierOffers(ID={{rounds.response.body.$.value[0].offers[0].ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/DispatchService.award
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Close the open round: its INVITED offers become EXPIRED
### (run after a start tender without award; expect 400 ROUND_CLOSED otherwise)
POST {{dispatch}}/Dispatch({{dispatchKey}})/DispatchService.closeRound
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Report an execution exception
POST {{dispatch}}/Dispatch({{dispatchKey}})/DispatchService.reportException
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "DELAY", "reason": "TRAFFIC", "minutes": 45 }

### Cancel the tender: FAILED, closes an open round, adds a note (reason is mandatory)
POST {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders('{{order}}')/DispatchService.cancelTender
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Shipper postponed the pickup" }

### The dispatch with rounds, offers, exceptions and notes
GET {{dispatch}}/Dispatch({{dispatchKey}})?$expand=rounds($expand=offers),exceptions,notes
Authorization: {{auth}}

### satish (CarrierDesk) is refused (expect 403)
GET {{dispatch}}/FreightOrders?$top=1
Authorization: Basic satish:
